      "id": "2073555742813200390",
      "text": "most of saas is truly dead haha\n\ni built two tools i've always wanted.\nfable one-shotted 99% of both in minutes lol.\n\nginger garlic\ntype whatever you want in any text box, hit a hotkey, and apple foundation models rewrite it with correct grammar in your writing style. no api. no cost.\n\ndrive cleanser\npaste your drive link, and it organizes everything for you. it finds duplicates, clusters similar photos, identifies your family, groups memories, and helps you delete the photos and videos you don't actually need.\nfor ref, my own drive: 500gb+, 80k+ files. it handled the whole thing.",
