      "id": "2072688231720616355",
      "text": "Fable 5 is so fcking good it scares me for the future of humanity\n\nIf you are just using it as a search engine you probably don't understand yet\n\nBut give it an ACTUALLY DIFFICULT task and it literally 1 shots it. Every time.  It's fcking obscene. \n\nFor example I literally have a super complicated dashboard running one of my businesses.  Opus 4.8 literally couldn't get it right for 2 MONTHS on like 3k of credit spend.  \n\nFable one shotted it in 4 minutes. 😅\n\nI can't even imagine the knock on effects of every smart entrepreneur having access to intelligence this powerful (and MORE powerful) as we go forward into the future. \n\nPeople are vastly underestimating the exponential effects here because they've never built anything. \n\nReal builders are now 1,000,000x more powerful.\n\nIt's truly wild.",
